","body":"Imperative assembly"}],"correct_option":"C","explanation":"SQL specifies the rows wanted without describing an iteration algorithm.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 6, Programming paradigms, Java strings and numeric types [SHA-256 0ddec95c2c4048ef8e307abe08dfae931c61009ccba55e39c258a6c0d50e970c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":2,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t2-gap1","pool":"battle","usage":["battle"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"Java String objects are mutable or immutable? ____.","explanation":"The reviewed lesson explains why the answer is immutable.","gaps":[{"index":0,"accepted_answers":["immutable"]}],"answer_format":"fill_in_gap","battle_seconds":15,"battle_reading_seconds":8,"source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 6, Programming paradigms, Java strings and numeric types [SHA-256 0ddec95c2c4048ef8e307abe08dfae931c61009ccba55e39c258a6c0d50e970c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":2,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t2-gap2","pool":"battle","usage":["battle"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"For int a = 5 and double b = 10.0, a / b is ____.","explanation":"A double operand makes this floating-point division.","gaps":[{"index":0,"accepted_answers":["0.5",".5","zero point five"]}],"answer_format":"fill_in_gap","battle_seconds":15,"battle_reading_seconds":8,"source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 6, Programming paradigms, Java strings and numeric types [SHA-256 0ddec95c2c4048ef8e307abe08dfae931c61009ccba55e39c258a6c0d50e970c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":3,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t3-q1","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"Which is a valid Java entry-point signature?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"public static void main(String[] args)"},{"label":"B","body":"public void static main(String args)"},{"label":"C","body":"public class main(String args)"},{"label":"D","body":"public static main(String[] args)"}],"correct_option":"A","explanation":"The standard entry point is public static void main with a String array parameter.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 8, Java program repair, casting and flowcharts [SHA-256 154729d6087f8caf24b4544e60204161082059cb7a22eefb85e47126d705325c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":3,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t3-q2","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"What does (int)5.8 evaluate to in Java?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"6"},{"label":"B","body":"5.8"},{"label":"C","body":"An error for every cast"},{"label":"D","body":"5"}],"correct_option":"D","explanation":"A narrowing cast from double to int truncates the fractional part.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 8, Java program repair, casting and flowcharts [SHA-256 154729d6087f8caf24b4544e60204161082059cb7a22eefb85e47126d705325c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":3,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t3-q3","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"Which escape sequence inserts a tab in a Java string?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"\\n"},{"label":"B","body":"\\b"},{"label":"C","body":"\\t"},{"label":"D","body":"/t"}],"correct_option":"C","explanation":"The tab escape uses a backslash followed by t.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 8, Java program repair, casting and flowcharts [SHA-256 154729d6087f8caf24b4544e60204161082059cb7a22eefb85e47126d705325c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":3,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t3-q4","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"In F = G*m1*m2/(r*r), which input requires a nonzero check?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"m2 only"},{"label":"B","body":"r"},{"label":"C","body":"G only"},{"label":"D","body":"m1 only"}],"correct_option":"B","explanation":"A zero distance would put zero in the denominator.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 8, Java program repair, casting and flowcharts [SHA-256 154729d6087f8caf24b4544e60204161082059cb7a22eefb85e47126d705325c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":3,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t3-gap1","pool":"battle","usage":["battle"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"The Java escape for a horizontal tab is ____. Write the backslash escape.","explanation":"The tab escape uses a backslash followed by t.","gaps":[{"index":0,"accepted_answers":["\\t"]}],"answer_format":"fill_in_gap","battle_seconds":15,"battle_reading_seconds":8,"source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 8, Java program repair, casting and flowcharts [SHA-256 154729d6087f8caf24b4544e60204161082059cb7a22eefb85e47126d705325c]"},{"course_code":"COS 201","topic":3,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"cos-201-photo20261025-t3-gap2","pool":"battle","usage":["battle"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"In F = G*m1*m2/(r*r), the distance variable is ____.","explanation":"The standard entry point is public static void main with a String array parameter.","gaps":[{"index":0,"accepted_answers":["r"]}],"answer_format":"fill_in_gap","battle_seconds":15,"battle_reading_seconds":8,"source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 8, Java program repair, casting and flowcharts [SHA-256 154729d6087f8caf24b4544e60204161082059cb7a22eefb85e47126d705325c]"},{"course_code":"CSC 203","topic":1,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"csc-203-photo20261025-t1-q1","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"Of 50 students, 28 take A, 22 take B and 12 take both. How many take only A?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"40"},{"label"