nly"},{"label":"B","body":"Retirement"},{"label":"C","body":"Implementation"},{"label":"D","body":"Requirements elicitation"}],"correct_option":"C","explanation":"Implementation turns the design into executable code.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 10, SDLC, software processes and products [SHA-256 9fe400b4c14505c025a738ed6fa9a8066f65a4a7afd67e38f3d7e1ddf048f31f]"},{"course_code":"SEN 201","topic":1,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"sen-201-photo20261025-t1-q2","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"In an SDLC, making a completed system available in production is primarily what?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"Initial feasibility analysis"},{"label":"B","body":"Deployment"},{"label":"C","body":"Elicitation"},{"label":"D","body":"Scope definition"}],"correct_option":"B","explanation":"Deployment installs and releases the system into its operating environment.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 10, SDLC, software processes and products [SHA-256 9fe400b4c14505c025a738ed6fa9a8066f65a4a7afd67e38f3d7e1ddf048f31f]"},{"course_code":"SEN 201","topic":1,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"sen-201-photo20261025-t1-q3","pool":"learning","usage":["review","practice","mock"],"difficulty":"intermediate","prompt":"What is an outcome of a software process activity called?","options":[{"label":"A","body":"A product"},{"label":"B","body":"A keyboard"},{"label":"C","body":"An unrelated threat"},{"label":"D","body":"An organisational chart only"}],"correct_option":"A","explanation":"A process activity produces an outcome or product.","answer_format":"standard","source_reference":"Supplied examination photo 10, SDLC, software processes and products [SHA-256 9fe400b4c14505c025a738ed6fa9a8066f65a4a7afd67e38f3d7e1ddf048f31f]"},{"course_code":"SEN 201","topic":1,"photo_lesson":true,"logical_question_key":"sen-201-photo20261025-t1-q4","poo